{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的部分叙事分行较碎，因果关系需要跨行拼接，连续阅读的顺滑程度不如Y左栏的完整句子。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键落点，话与感受交替出现，感受又能随音乐时点进入，观众比较容易边听边抓住重点。Y的完整句子在解释人物动机和心理因果时更顺畅，但右栏短词数量较多、缺少明确的出现时序，有些段落容易读成情绪标签的集合。整体而言，X更能让人跟住人物从舍不得、怀疑、孤独到接受并继续生活的变化，而且感受描写有具体的声音、身体反应和情绪层次，不只是给音乐贴情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4149b7da-5efb-4116-ab14-1ae813ccb9c1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T032632047605Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:27:24.660317+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d80427ca6311580d7e735d899ecf9a0c70acd662ab3b5825df4863fad6908e1b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme